-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Ermes Nascimento<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Felipe Dos Santos Batista<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Gabriel Elias Nunes Mendes<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Gabrielle Pinheiro Sanches<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Guilherme Soares dos Santos<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Ismael Clarindo Candido da Silva<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\"> <br></span></span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Joao Honorato<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Luiz Alberto Da Silva Costa<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Michael Moraes<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Rafael Borges Avelino<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Reginaldo Corr&ecirc;a Diniz<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Renata Ayuki Suizu<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Ryan Santos<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Samuel Sales<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Sheila Regina Xavier<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Sidney Silva<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Sophia Abe Roveda<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Van&eacute;cia Cirqueira costa</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">*</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">A partir do dia 4 de setembro, est&atilde;o abertas as inscri&ccedil;&otilde;es para a <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">Oficina de harmonia</em>, pensada para entender a combina&ccedil;&atilde;o de sons e a execu&ccedil;&atilde;o de notas que expressam as mais diversas sensa&ccedil;&otilde;es. No total, ser&atilde;o disponibilizadas 20 vagas, tendo como p&uacute;blico-alvo professores, m&uacute;sicos e pessoas interessadas em m&uacute;sica e que possuam conhecimento pr&eacute;vio em algum instrumento musical.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Ministrado pelo ex-professor da escola do Audit&oacute;rio Ibirapuera Amador Longhini, o curso tem in&iacute;cio marcado para o dia 7 de outubro e se estende at&eacute; 9 de dezembro, com dura&ccedil;&atilde;o de dez semanas e duas horas em cada encontro. A oficina acontece de forma presencial no pr&eacute;dio do Ita&uacute; Cultural (IC), sempre aos s&aacute;bados, das 14h &agrave;s 16h.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">As inscri&ccedil;&otilde;es se encerram no dia 15 de setembro, &agrave;s 18 horas. A <span style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">chamada dos aprovados ser&aacute; divulgada aqui </span>no <em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\">site</em>&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">entre os dias </span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">25 e 29 do mesmo m&ecirc;s. <a href=\"https://itaucultural.formstack.com/forms/oficina_de_musica_com_amador_longhini\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Inscreva-se pelo formul&aacute;rio</a>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">Oficina de harmonia </span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">(com interpreta&ccedil;&atilde;o de Libras)<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">s&aacute;bados <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">7 de outubro </strong>a <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">9 de dezembro de 2023<br></strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&agrave;s <strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">14h<br></strong></span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">[dura&ccedil;&atilde;o aproximada: 120 minutos]<br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">20 vagas</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; color: black; mso-fareast-language: PT-BR;\">atividade presencial</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"f